hadiths[17]{hadithnumber,text}:
"891","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmatay hue suna: Jo shakhs kisi momin gardan (ghulam) ko azaad karay to Allah us ke har uzw ke badlay (us ka) aik uzw aag se azaad karay ga, yahan tak ke us ki sharmgah ke badlay us ki sharmgah (azaad karay ga). (Muslim: 4/217). Baab: Betay ka baap ko azaad karnay ke baaray mein."
"892","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Beta baap ka badla nahi chuka sakta siwae is ke ke usay ghulam paye phir usay khareed kar azaad kar de. (Muslim: 4/218). Baab: Jo ghulam mein apna hissa azaad karay."
"893","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jo shakhs ghulam mein apna hissa azaad karay aur us ke paas itna maal ho jo ghulam ki qeemat ko pahunchay to us par munasib qeemat lagayi jaye, phir wo apne shareekon ko un ke hissay de aur ghulam us ki taraf se azaad ho jaye, warna jitna us se azaad hua utna azaad hua. (Muslim: 4/212). Baab: Us mein se, aur mehnat kara kar (qeemat ada karnay) ka zikr."
"894","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Jo shakhs ghulam mein apna tukra (hissa) azaad karay to usay poora azaad karna us ke maal se hoga agar wo maal wala ho, aur agar maal wala na ho to ghulam se mehnat karayi jaye aur us par naaqabil-e-bardasht bojh na daala jaye. (Muslim). (Shiqs se murad hissa hai, thora ho ya zyada, usay shirk bhi kehtay hain.)"
"895","[AI-translation] Imran bin Husain (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke aik mard ne, us ki riwayat ke izafay mein hai ke Ansaar mein se tha, apne marnay ke waqt apne chhe ghulam azaad kiye jabke un ke siwa us ka koi maal na tha, to Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne unhein bulaya aur unhein teen hisson mein taqseem kiya, phir un ke darmiyan qura andazi ki, to do ko azaad kiya aur chaar ko ghulam rakha, aur Aap ne usay sakht baat kahi. (Muslim: 5/97). Baab: Wala us ke liye hai jo azaad karay."
"896","[AI-translation] Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Barira mere paas aayi aur kaha: Beshak mere ghar walon ne mujh se no auqiya par nau saalon mein kitabat (azaadi ka muahida) ki hai, har saal mein aik ooqiya, to meri madad karo. To main ne us se kaha: Agar tumharay ghar walay chahein ke main unhein aik hi baar poori (raqam) gin dun aur tumhein azaad kar dun aur wala mera ho to main karun gi. To us ne ye baat apne ghar walon se zikr ki to unhon ne inkar kiya siwae is ke ke wala un ka ho. Phir wo mere paas aayi aur ye baat zikr ki. Unhon ne kaha: To main ne usay jhirka to us ne kaha: Allah ki qasam phir aisa nahi hoga. Unhon ne kaha: To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne suna aur mujh se poocha, to main ne Aap ko bataya. To Aap ne farmaya: Usay khareed lo aur azaad kar do aur un ke liye wala ki shart laga lo, beshak wala usi ke liye hai jo azaad karay. To main ne aisa kiya. Unhon ne kaha: Phir Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne shaam ko khutba diya, Allah ki hamd ki aur Us ki sana bayan ki jis ka Wo ahl hai, phir farmaya: Amma baad! Logon ka kya haal hai ke wo aisi shartein lagatay hain jo Allah ki kitab mein nahi. Jo shart Allah ki kitab mein nahi wo baatil hai chahe sau shartein hon. Allah ki kitab zyada haq wali hai aur Allah ki shart zyada mazboot hai. Tum mein se baaz mardon ka kya haal hai, un mein se aik kehta hai: Falan ko azaad karo aur wala mera ho, wala to sirf us ka hai jo azaad karay. (Muslim: 4/214). Baab: Us mein se, aur azaad honay wali (aurat) ko apne shohar ke baaray mein ikhtiyar."
"897","[AI-translation] Aisha (raziyallahu anha), Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki zauja, se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Barira ke muamlay mein teen sunnatein thin: Usay (azaadi ke baad apne shohar ke baaray mein) ikhtiyar diya gaya, aur usay sadqa (ka gosht) mila to Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke liye wo hadiya ho gaya, aur Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke wala usi ka hai jo azaad karay. (Muslim). (Wala se murad wala-e-ataaqat hai jo azaadi ki wajah se miras ka haq hai.)"
"898","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne wala ke baichnay aur usay hadiya karnay se mana farmaya. (Muslim: 4/216). Baab: Jo apne aaqaon ke siwa kisi qaum se wala ka rishta joray."
"899","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Jo shakhs apne aaqaon ki ijazat ke baghair kisi qaum se (wala ka) rishta joray to us par Allah ki, farishton ki aur tamaam logon ki lanat hai, Allah qayamat ke din us se na farz qabool karay ga aur na nafl. (Muslim: 4/216). Baab: Jab apne ghulam ko maaray to usay azaad karay."
"900","[AI-translation] Abu Mas'ud Ansari (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main apne aik ghulam ko maar raha tha, aik riwayat ke izafay mein hai ke wo kehnay laga: Main Allah ki panah maangta hun. Unhon ne kaha: Wo usay maartay rahay to us ne kaha: Main Rasoolullah ki panah maangta hun, to us ne usay chhor diya. To main ne apne peechay se aik awaz suni: Ae Abu Mas'ud! Jaan lo ke Allah tum par tumharay is par qadir honay se zyada qadir hai. To main ne mur kar dekha to wo Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) thay. To main ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool! Wo Allah ki raza ke liye azaad hai. To Aap ne farmaya: Khabardar! Agar tum aisa na kartay to tumhein aag jhulas deti ya aag tumhein chhuti. (Muslim: 5/92). (Ye izafa Sahih Muslim se hai.)"
"901","[AI-translation] Zazan se riwayat hai ke Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) ne apne aik ghulam ko bulaya aur us ki peeth par nishan dekha to us se kaha: Kya main ne tumhein takleef pahunchayi? Us ne kaha: Nahi. Unhon ne kaha: Phir tum azaad ho. Unhon ne kaha: Phir unhon ne zameen se koi cheez uthayi aur kaha: Mujhe is mein itnay wazan ke barabar bhi ajar nahi. Main ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmatay hue suna: Jo shakhs apne ghulam ko wajah ke baghair had ki saza de ya usay thappar maaray to us ka kaffara ye hai ke usay azaad kar de. (Muslim)."
"902","[AI-translation] Suwaid bin Muqarrin (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke un ki aik londi thi jisay aik insan ne thappar maara, to Suwaid ne us se kaha: Kya tum nahi jantay ke chehra (par maarna) haraam hai? To us ne kaha: Tum ne mujhe dekha jabke main Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke saath apne saat bhaiyon mein satwan tha aur hamaray paas aik ke siwa koi khadim na tha, to ham mein se aik ne qasd kar ke usay thappar maara, to Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne hamein hukm diya ke ham usay azaad kar dein. (Muslim: 5/91). Baab: Apne ghulam par zina ki tohmat laganay walay par sakhti."
"903","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Abul Qasim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jo shakhs apne ghulam par zina ki tohmat lagaye to qayamat ke din us par had qaim ki jaye gi siwae is ke ke wo waisa hi ho jaisa us ne kaha. (Muslim: 5/92). Baab: Ghulamon ke sath khanay aur libas mein ehsaan aur un se taqat se zyada kaam na lena."
"904","[AI-translation] Marur bin Suwaid se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ham Abu Zarr ke paas se Rabza mein guzray jabke un par aik chadar thi aur un ke ghulam par us jaisi thi. To ham ne kaha: Ae Abu Zarr! Agar tum donon ko jama kar letay to aik jora ban jata. To unhon ne kaha: Mere aur mere aik deeni bhai ke darmiyan baat hui thi aur us ki maan ajami thi to main ne usay us ki maan ka taana diya, to us ne Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se meri shikayat ki. To main Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se mila to Aap ne farmaya: Ae Abu Zarr! Beshak tum aisay aadmi ho jis mein jahiliyat hai. Main ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool! Jo mardon ko gaali de to wo (jawaban) us ke baap aur us ki maan ko gaali detay hain. Aap ne farmaya: Ae Abu Zarr! Beshak tum aisay aadmi ho jis mein jahiliyat hai. Wo tumharay bhai hain, Allah ne unhein tumharay haathon ke neechay kiya hai, to unhein us mein se khilao jo tum khatay ho aur unhein us mein se pehnao jo tum pehantay ho, aur un se wo kaam na lo jo un par ghalib aa jaye, phir agar tum un se (aisa) kaam lo to un ki madad karo. (Muslim: 5/93)"
"905","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se kisi ka khadim us ka khana tayyar karay phir usay le kar aaye jabke us ne us ki garmi aur us ka dhuan jhela hai to usay apne saath bitha le aur khilaye, phir agar khana thora ho jo honton ko (lag kar khatm ho jaye) to us mein se aik ya do luqmay us ke haath mein rakh de. Dawood, yani Ibn Qais, ne kaha: Yani aik ya do luqmay. (Muslim: 5/94). Baab: Ghulam ka sawab jab wo apne aaqa ka khairkhwah ho aur Allah ki ibadat achi tarah karay."
"906","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Beshak ghulam jab apne aaqa ka khairkhwah ho aur Allah ki ibadat achi tarah karay to us ke liye dohra ajar hai. (Muslim). (Mashfooh se murad thora khana hai.)"
"907","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Naik ghulam ke liye do ajar hain. Us Zaat ki qasam jis ke haath mein Abu Huraira ki jaan hai! Agar Allah ke rastay mein jihad, hajj aur apni maan se neki na hoti to main pasand karta ke main ghulam hotay hue marun. Unhon ne kaha: Aur hamein khabar pahunchi ke Abu Huraira hajj na kartay thay yahan tak ke un ki walida wafaat paa gayeen, un ki khidmat ki wajah se. (Muslim: 5/94). Baab: Mudabbar ke baichnay ke baaray mein jab us ke paas us ke siwa maal na ho; is mein Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhuma) ki hadees hai jo kitab-un-nafaqat ke awwal mein 883 number par guzar chuki hai. (Nafl hajj murad hai, kyunke unhon ne Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke zamanay mein hajjat-ul-Islam ada kiya tha.)"
